flowchart TD
    subgraph origin[Origin node - current behavior]
        call[Guest CRDT host call] --> validate[Validate input and reserve queue space]
        validate --> update[Compute updated CRDT state]
        update --> persist[Persist CRDT state and materialized value]
        persist --> publish[Publish state in memory]
        publish --> enqueue[Enqueue operation]
        enqueue --> remember[Broadcast loop persists seen ID and bounded op log]
    end
    subgraph receiver[Receiving node - current behavior]
        check{OpId already seen?}
        check -->|Yes| ignore[Skip duplicate]
        check -->|No| plan[Plan CRDT update]
        plan --> persistRemote[Persist state, seen ID, and op-log batch]
        persistRemote --> publishRemote[Publish state in memory]
    end
    remember --> push[PushOps to connected peers]
    push --> check
